stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : POST /payroll/generate, month-end job or POST /payroll
    pending --> paid : PATCH /payroll/id/mark-paid
    on_hold --> paid : PATCH /payroll/id/mark-paid
    pending --> on_hold : PATCH /payroll/id/mark-on-hold or PATCH /payroll/id status
    on_hold --> pending : PATCH /payroll/id status
    pending --> deleted : DELETE /payroll/id
    on_hold --> deleted : DELETE /payroll/id
    paid --> deleted : DELETE /payroll/id - only when no commission was paid out
    deleted --> [*]
